Z||000025||Black88GT||02-10-2001||06:08 PM||||Speaking of weather, it was 71 degrees on Friday, I got to take the t-tops off for the first time in months.  It was great.  Then reality came back in today, back down to 30 degrees and supposed to get colder tomorrow.<P>About the forum thing, I don't think that people here get into a lot of flame wars.  Hell, compared to every other forum I have been to, we are by far the most peaceful.  I mean if that spark plug thread was the best we can do (in terms of flame wars), we're considered Saints in the eyes of different car forum members....<P>Hey Jeff (2xsess), ever since you have been in Georgia, you have been saying "dang" a lot... lmao...  &lt;hick voice&gt; GET 'R DONE!!<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||10
